sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Human adopter
    participant CLI as naos adopt --mode greenfield
    participant Intake as Intake/install-plan
    participant Challenge as Challenge reports
    participant Surface as AI-surface budget
    participant SpecPack as Spec-pack lifecycle checks
    participant Trace as Spec/source traceability checks
    participant Decision as Install decision record
    participant Review as Human review

    Note over User,Review: Preview generation is exercised on Linux/Python 3.11.<br/>Create-only activation is currently supported only on Darwin ARM64/CPython 3.11-3.13#59;<br/>unsupported tuples refuse before target mutation.
    User->>CLI: Preview greenfield adoption
    CLI->>Intake: Collect purpose, profile, risk, evidence expectations
    Intake->>Challenge: Challenge assumptions before build
    Challenge->>Surface: Check generated AI/governance instruction context health
    Challenge->>SpecPack: Run contract, materialization dry-run, and worksheet when applicable
    SpecPack->>Trace: Run spec-cascade when specs/source refs exist
    Trace->>Decision: Record facts, unknowns, traceability gaps, next actions
    Decision->>Review: Present adoption evidence
    Review->>Review: Activate, defer, remediate, or record residual risk
